;; THE DUMP'S FIELD TABLE: one row per printed field, [arena first-cell kind key default arg], arenas in `ea` order.
;; kind 1 int, 2 centi-units as points, 3 box (4 cells), 4 segment (4 cells, `[x0,y0,x1,y1]` in points), 5 colour,
;; 6 text run (2 cells), 7 run `[first,count]`, 8 enum (arg: the `ev-fenum` table), 9 bit set (arg: the `ev-fbits` table),
;; 10 pixel box `[x,y,w,h]`, 11 packed ASCII, 12 two ints, 13 two centi-unit values in points.
;; A field equal to its default is not written (MIN: never omitted). A run is omitted when its first cell is the default and
;; its second the arg; a two-int `z` likewise.
